## words not found (AC-007, R-14)
mismatches []: for all 47 questions, every named word occurs in no journal and every word the census finds absent is named.
Off-topic: 11 of 12 name their absent words. N02 names none: its words all occur in memory; its one rare word occurs only in the asking run's journal (the run that wrote the question file), which counts for absence by R-15. A question-set matter: N02 needs a key word that occurs nowhere, or another kind.
